; coredll-doc.def -- coredll.dll export surface for Windows CE.
;
; Copyright (c) 2026 Akari API contributors
; SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
;
; Two evidence tiers (docs/clean-room.md section 3):
;
; 1. DOC-DERIVED -- each name appears on an official Microsoft CE
;    documentation page whose Requirements row names Coredll.lib as
;    the link library (tools/ce-manifest.py + tools/ce-fetch.py +
;    tools/ce3-collect.py harvests; docs/inventory.md records the
;    pages).  Entries added in the M104 pass: names documented as
;    Coredll.lib and declared in include/ that the original
;    generation missed (33 names).
; 2. EXPORT-SURFACE-VERIFIED -- names observed on the device-dump-
;    audited coredll import surfaces of the CE 4/5/6 sysroot
;    (corpus coredll/coredll4.def, coredll.def, coredll6.def,
;    coredll6-x86.def; clean-room.md 3.2 observable facts).  This
;    tier closes the gap between the documentation harvest and the
;    real coredll surface, including the CRT exports coredll.dll
;    provides (75 C++ mangled names).
;
; No shared-source/VS/Platform-Builder source was used.  Ordinals
; are not published; entries are name-only.
LIBRARY coredll.dll
